*.mpq
*.MPQ
*.dbc
*.blp
*.m2
*.mdx
*.wmo
*.adt
*.wdt
*.wdl
*.skin
*.glb
*.gltf

# Converted asset outputs (should only ever be under cache/, but just in case)
**/public/assets/
